# AURA — Supabase realtime (optional)
#
# Leave both values empty and AURA runs in LOCAL MODE: everything behaves exactly
# as before, with requests and stay sessions kept in this browser's localStorage.
# Fill them in (project Settings → API) to switch the guest app and the staff
# dashboard to live, cross-device sync through Supabase Postgres + realtime.
#
# The anon key is public by design; access is governed by the (currently
# demo-permissive) RLS policies in supabase/schema.sql.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
